{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新年伊始，到了新学期。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明在这里还没待半年，但总感觉已经在这当了好久的学生了。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "明明在这里还没待半年，但总感觉已经在这当了好久的学生了。", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，学校合并的事现在变得怎么样了」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个嘛，有很多各种各样的传言呢。\\n　只不过应该还是有在往好的一面发展吧」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "「这个嘛，有很多各种各样的传言呢。　只不过应该还是有在往好的一面发展吧」", "plain_idx": 204, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1765", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟是由那个濑名校长一手操办的」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1766", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太也很认可那个人吗？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎么说呢，至少她确实不是那种只是口头说说而已的人」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1767", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起这个，那之后你怎么样了。都还顺利吧？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1768", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，托你的福」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一边望向远处正在和别的女生说话的纱凪，\\n一边回着他的话。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": "我一边望向远处正在和别的女生说话的纱凪，一边回着他的话。", "plain_idx": 215, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那之后和她的关系进展非常顺利。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一起的时候真的都非常开心。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我们的关系还有一个人没有对她说。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了，突然一脸愁容？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1769", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然很幸福但也还是有着烦恼吗」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1770", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、该怎么说呢。\\n　我和她相处得确实非常不错」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「嗯、该怎么说呢。　我和她相处得确实非常不错」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，感觉我们还没有成为真正意义上的恋人」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经没有什么时间了。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很快，美羽学姐就要从这所学校毕业了。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必须得在这之前和她说明。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪的事情。", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过这事也需要她下定决心。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……说的是呢。\\n　结果，我们还没有和美羽学姐说上话年就过了……」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「……说的是呢。　结果，我们还没有和美羽学姐说上话年就过了……」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4605", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还是不愿意向美羽学姐坦白吗？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4606", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只不过，必须得要在最近和学姐报告了」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4607", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她如果已经下定决心了的话，\\n也不用我再说些什么了。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "她如果已经下定决心了的话，也不用我再说些什么了。", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，在进活动室前……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4608", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一边说着一边拉着我的衣袖。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在这里？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……到那边的角落去」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4609", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新的一年，即使到了第三学期，纱凪也完全没变，\\n还是那么喜欢接吻。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "新的一年，即使到了第三学期，纱凪也完全没变，还是那么喜欢接吻。", "plain_idx": 250, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仅仅是接触着彼此的唇，\\n我们就能相互确认对方的爱。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "仅仅是接触着彼此的唇，我们就能相互确认对方的爱。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于用语言表达感情就变得害羞的纱凪来说，\\n她似乎更喜欢用接吻这个方式。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": "对于用语言表达感情就变得害羞的纱凪来说，她似乎更喜欢用接吻这个方式。", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也因为这样，她索吻的方式变得一天比一天熟练了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总感觉，我变成接吻狂魔一样了……\\n　这样子沉迷于其中……真的好吗」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": "「总感觉，我变成接吻狂魔一样了……　这样子沉迷于其中……真的好吗」", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6852", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比起接吻狂魔，撒娇狂魔更适合点吧。\\n　最近你都不主动来亲我了」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「比起接吻狂魔，撒娇狂魔更适合点吧。　最近你都不主动来亲我了」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕、毕竟我们身高差很大嘛，\\n　平常我这边很难亲到你」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「毕、毕竟我们身高差很大嘛，　平常我这边很难亲到你」", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6853", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以最近都是要由我去主动吗。\\n只不过比起纱凪在接受我的情况，感觉还是我接受着她的邀请的情况更多呢。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "所以最近都是要由我去主动吗。只不过比起纱凪在接受我的情况，感觉还是我接受着她的邀请的情况更多呢。", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6854", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在索吻之后，她就一直这样无言地等着我。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "在索吻之后，她就一直这样无言地等着我。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这个时候她那又害羞又期待的表情，真是可爱极了……", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "这个时候她那又害羞又期待的表情，真是可爱极了……", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啾」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……诶，\\n　就脸而已吗……？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": "「嗯……诶，　就脸而已吗……？」", "plain_idx": 271, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6855", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不小心看入迷了，就不自觉亲了上去。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在她那一脸痛苦的表情也让我感觉无比可爱。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "现在她那一脸痛苦的表情也让我感觉无比可爱。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是脸还不够吗？」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才、才不是……啊、嗯」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6856", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我稍微强硬点地去亲上了纱凪的唇。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……唔唔、嗯……」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6857", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然这里是后院的角落，但再怎么说也是校内。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我只是亲了一会儿就停下了。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然只有一小会儿，但刚刚的意识全部集中到了唇上。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连纱凪她那由于我突然亲上来而僵住的动作都传过来了。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……啊，新吾」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6858", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，没事的」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一把搂住她的腰，\\n支撑着她似乎要软下去的身体。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "我一把搂住她的腰，支撑着她似乎要软下去的身体。", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从几天前开始就是这样了。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每当我们接吻后，\\n她就会变成这样一副要站不稳的样子。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "每当我们接吻后，她就会变成这样一副要站不稳的样子。", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可能亲吻对纱凪来说就是这么特别的行为吧。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还能动吗？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再、再稍微这样子一下……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6859", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于正依赖着我的纱凪，我更加用力地抱紧了她。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯嗯唔」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6860", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后纱凪也用她那使不上劲的手抱过我的头，\\n把身体更加靠了过来。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "然后纱凪也用她那使不上劲的手抱过我的头，把身体更加靠了过来。", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，我们在角落里偷偷地拥抱着彼此。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6861", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的呼吸、体温、触感、重量，\\n还有唇边残留的接吻的余韵，她的一切我都爱着……", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "她的呼吸、体温、触感、重量，还有唇边残留的接吻的余韵，她的一切我都爱着……", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但仅是接吻就变成这个样子的话，\\n果然“这之后”的事还是不能轻易去做的。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "但仅是接吻就变成这个样子的话，果然“这之后”的事还是不能轻易去做的。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使破瓜之痛已经完全好了。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过，要满足她的撒娇，\\n得让她感受到非常非常深的满足感。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "只不过，要满足她的撒娇，得让她感受到非常非常深的满足感。", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，怎么了吗？为什么大家都集中到一块了……」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4618", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "进到活动室后，我们发现大家围着美羽学姐形成了一个圈。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「出现了什么问题吗？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、不是的。与其说是问题，就是有些在意的事……」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3325", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在意的事？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽学姐似乎看到了体型很大的熊喵」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6601", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「体型很大的，难道说是除了我们这里的别的熊喵？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0628", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有目击者说大熊喵是带着孩子的」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5382", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是说，\\n　这条街的某个地方似乎有着熊喵一族……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": "「就是说，　这条街的某个地方似乎有着熊喵一族……」", "plain_idx": 334, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3983", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵一族……？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4619", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪看了看彼此。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵在去年年终的时候，\\n　就一直在发出像是在呼唤着谁的叫声」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「小熊喵在去年年终的时候，　就一直在发出像是在呼唤着谁的叫声」", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3326", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「应该是本能理解了吧。\\n　自己的同类在这附近……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「应该是本能理解了吧。　自己的同类在这附近……」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6602", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果真的有熊喵一族的话，\\n　我们该想办法让它们见上一面吗？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「如果真的有熊喵一族的话，　我们该想办法让它们见上一面吗？」", "plain_idx": 347, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3984", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3327", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐她似乎十分在意这件事。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许也正因为如此，她看上去十分疲惫。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之，我们需要更多的信息呢」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……美羽学姐，你还好吗？」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4620", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。抱歉、不小心发了下呆」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3328", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家如果在哪里见到了像小熊喵一样的动物的话，\\n　要告诉我哦」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "「大家如果在哪里见到了像小熊喵一样的动物的话，　要告诉我哦」", "plain_idx": 358, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3329", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，先暂时这样看看情况吧。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过熊喵会有同类在也是挺理所当然的。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果能好好相处的话，还是想让它们见上一面的……", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
